  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ab8efda421d81ab22145ef/step-370e1248.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add BBQ spice blend, black beans, tomato paste, the water, brown sugar and 1/2 the diced tomatoes and stir to combine. Season with salt. Simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ab8efda421d81ab22145ef/step-685054dd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Lay mini flour tortillas on a flat surface. Divide bean mixture between tortillas (about 1/2 cup each). Roll up tightly and place, seam-side down, in a medium baking dish, ensuring they fit snugly.\n• Pour remaining diced tomatoes over rolled tortillas. Sprinkle with cheeseand grill until warmed through and cheese is golden, 6-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ab8efda421d81ab22145ef/step-12819b3a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and a light drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss to combine.\n• Divide the enchiladas between plates and top with sour cream. Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ab8efda421d81ab22145ef/step-d09ce676.jpg"
    }
  ]
